# The 10 scripts in Hinglish Roman, word for word as spoken. *word(s)* = yellow keyword in subtitles.
R = {
1: """Agar aap bhi apne phone ya ghar ke Wi-Fi se apni video khud dekhte hain, toh aap ek aisi anjaani *galti* kar rahe hain jo aapke channel ko chupchaap *khatam* kar rahi hai... aur woh galti kya hai, bas agle *10 second* mein samajh aa jayega!
YouTube ka algorithm aapke *IP address* aur *device fingerprint* ko turant track kar leta hai. Ek hi Wi-Fi se baar-baar playback hone par system views ko *freeze* kar deta hai. Lekin asli khatra sirf views rukne ka nahi hai... isse bhi bada jhatka tab lagta hai jab aapka ek khaas metric *crash* ho jata hai!
Jab aap khud video chalakar turant band karte hain, toh aapka *Average View Duration* gir jata hai aur algorithm aapki reach hamesha ke liye *maar* deta hai! Aur agar channel monetized hai, toh *AdSense* invalid traffic ke kaaran hamesha ke liye band ho sakta hai.
Isliye apni video check karne ke liye hamesha YouTube Studio ke *Internal Preview* ka istemaal karein. Waise, kya aapne bhi ye galti ki hai? Comment mein batao aur aise secrets ke liye abhi *subscribe* karo!""",
2: """Kya aapke YouTube Shorts par bhi lagataar videos upload karne ke baad... achanak *0 views* aa rahe hain?! Aap soch rahe honge ki video kharab hai ya channel shadowban ho gaya hai... lekin asli wajah aapke video ki shuruaat mein chhupi woh *3 second* ki galti hai, jo algorithm ko aapki reach turant *freeze* karne par majboor kar deti hai!
YouTube ka algorithm har naye Short ko sabse pehle *100 se 500* viewers ki *Seed Audience* ke paas bhejta hai... aur wahin par ek hidden metric tay karta hai ki aapka video viral hoga ya nahi! Agar aapki opening kamzor hai aur aapka *Swipe-away* rate *40%* se upar chala gaya, toh algorithm aapki video ko *Feed Trap* mein daalkar hamesha ke liye lock kar deta hai!
Toh is 0 Views trap se bahar nikalne ka sahi tareeka kya hai?
Sabse pehle, *Hey Guys* jaise lambe intro banana band karein! YouTube Studio kholkar *Viewed vs Swiped Away* ratio check karein aur ise *70%* se upar maintain karein... saath hi, apna *phone verification* poora rakhein aur bina edit kiye ek hi video ko baar-baar *re-upload* karne ki galti kabhi na karein!
Kya aapki video bhi 0 views par atki hai? Neeche *TRAP* comment karein!""",
3: """*1,000 subscribers* hote hi kya bank khate mein seedhe paise aane lagte hain? Agar aapka jawab haan hai, toh aap bahut badi *galatfehmi* mein hain! Kyunki asli khel toh subscribers ke baad shuru hota hai, jiske baare mein *90 pratishat* naye creators ko pata hi nahi hota.
Sach yeh hai ki subscribers toh sirf *aadha raasta* hain. YouTube aapko ek rupaya bhi nahi dega, jab tak aap doosri sabse badi shart poori nahi karte. Woh shart hai pichhle 12 mahino mein *4,000 ghante* ka watch time, jo ki *1 February 2027* se *8000 ghante* hone wala hai, ya 90 dino mein *10 million* Shorts views, ye bhi *20 million* ho jayega...
Aur maan lijiye aapne yeh shart bhi poori kar li, tab bhi ek aakhri wajah se aapka pehla payment atak sakta hai! Jab tak aapka channel *policy review* pass nahi karta aur aapke AdSense khate mein kam se kam *100 dollar* poore nahi hote, YouTube kuch users ke liye ye minimum payment *20 dollar* test kar raha hai, aapko kya lagta hai 20 dollar zyada sahi rahega ya 100 dollar hi theek hai, *comment* karke batana""",
4: """Agar aap *AI voice* se Shorts bana rahe hain, toh ruk jao! YouTube ka ek aisa niyam hai jiski wajah se kai creators ke channel *demonetize* ho rahe hain... aur woh kaun si *1 badi galti* hai, woh aage jaanne ke baad aap chaunk jayenge.
Viewers baar-baar poochte hain ki kya AI stories, bhajan ya faceless Shorts par *Reused Content* aa jata hai? Iska sach yeh hai ki YouTube AI voice aur AI videos ko *100%* monetize karta hai... lekin sirf ek shart par! YouTube AI se nafrat nahi karta, balki us *Inauthentic Content* se nafrat karta hai jahan bina kisi original script ke sirf text *copy-paste* karke mass-produce templated video banaye jate hain.
Ab suno woh *1 setting* jo aapke channel ko surakshit rakhegi! Video upload karte samay YouTube Studio mein *Altered or Synthetic Content* disclosure ko hamesha *Yes* chunna anivarya hai. Aur sabse badi baat? YouTube ki official policy ke mutabik is label se aapki kamai ya views par *koi bura asar* nahi padta. Aise hi sahi YouTube growth tips ke liye abhi *Subscribe* karein!""",
5: """Shorts banakar *4,000 ghante* watch time poore karne ki soch rahe ho? Ruk jao! Ek aisa kadwa sach hai jo *99%* naye creators nahi jaante, aur isi wajah se unki mahino ki mehnat *barbaad* ho jati hai. Aap sochte hain ki aapke Studio analytics mein watch time badh raha hai, toh monetization bhi ho jayega. Lekin jab aap *Earn tab* khologe, toh woh saara watch time *gayab* milega! Aakhir ye watch time jata kahan hai? Aur kya koi aisa secret tareeka hai jisse Shorts ka watch time bhi 4,000 ghanton mein *100%* count ho jaye? Sachchai yeh hai ki Shorts feed se dekha gaya watch time 4,000 ghanton mein *zero* count hota hai! Lekin secret yeh hai ki agar aapka Short *Shorts Feed* se nahi, balki YouTube *Search* ya *Browse Features* se dekha jaye, toh uska watch time poora count hota hai. Toh ya toh apne Shorts ko search mein lao, ya phir 90 dino mein *10 million* views ka target poora karo, jo ki *1 February 2027* se *20 million* ho jayega. YouTube growth ke aise hi secrets ke liye abhi *subscribe* karo!""",
6: """Kya aapka do-teen saal purana YouTube channel band pada hai aur aap soch rahe hain ki use phir se chalayein ya *naya channel* banayein? Rukiye! Naya channel banane se pehle ek aisi chhupi hui sachchai jaan lijiye, jo *nabbe percent* naye creators ko barbaad kar deti hai.
YouTube algorithm kisi purane channel ko inactivity ki wajah se kabhi *block* nahi karta. Lekin jab aap naya channel banate hain, toh aapke saamne aata hai *cold-start trap*, jahan algorithm ko aapki sahi audience dhoondhne mein *mahine* lag jate hain.
Par yahan ek bada *twist* hai! Purane channel ke *dead subscribers* aapke *CTR* ko gira sakte hain... toh phir bina naya channel banaye views kaise layein? Iska secret tareeka hai: *search-driven topics* aur *Shorts* ka istemaal karna, jo seedhe naye darshakon ko kheenchte hain.
Aur naya channel sirf ek hi shart par banana chahiye... kya aap jaante hain woh shart kya hai? Sirf tab, jab aap apni *niche* sau percent badal rahe hon ya channel par *active strikes* chal rahe hon. Agar niche wahi hai, toh purane channel ko hi *revive* karein aur aisi hi growth tips ke liye *subscribe* karein!""",
7: """Din mein *3 Shorts* upload karne wale *90%* naye creators ka channel aakhir kyun *dead* ho jata hai? Iska sach jaankar aap chaunk jayenge.
Aapko lagta hoga ki zyada video yaani zyada views, lekin YouTube algorithm ka ek gupt niyam hai jo aapke hi teeno Shorts ko aapas mein *dushman* bana deta hai.
Jab aap ek hi din mein 3 Shorts daalte hain, toh algorithm unhe *200 se 500* views ke prarambhik *test group* mein bhejta hai.
Lekin asli twist yahan hai, aapke teeno video aapas mein hi views chheenne lagte hain, jise algorithmic *cannibalization* kehte hain.
Aur sabse bada khatra? YouTube 24 ghante mein sirf *3 notification* bhejta hai, jisse aapka antim video bina reach ke hi ruk jata hai.
Toh phir million views paane ka asli secret formula kya hai?
Woh secret hai, *quality over quantity!* Roz sirf *1 aisa Short* banao jiska shuruaati *3-second hook* tagda ho aur stayed-to-watch rate *80%* paar kar jaye.
Phir dekho algorithm kaise aapke video ko khud *viral loop* mein dhakel deta hai!""",
8: """Shorts mein *trending gaana* lagane ke baad bhi aapke channel par ek aisi chhupi hui galti hoti hai, jo aapke poore video ki kamai *shunya* kar sakti hai, aur zyadatar naye creators ko iska ehsaas tab hota hai jab unka video viral hone wala hota hai!
Agar aap bhi *CapCut* mein gaana edit karke description mein *credit* likh dete hain, toh ruk jaiye. YouTube ka *Content ID* scanner credit ko bilkul nahi maanta. Lekin woh sabse bada khatra kya hai jo *1 minute* se lambe Shorts par aate hi tabaahi macha deta hai?
Asli sach yeh hai ki 1 minute se lambe Shorts par agar bahar ka copyrighted music mila, toh YouTube us video ko poori duniya mein *globally block* kar deta hai!
Isse bachne ka sirf ek secret tareeka hai, Shorts banate samay hamesha YouTube app ke *Add Sound* feature ka hi istemaal karein, jisse aapko *in-product license* milta hai. Aur 1 minute se lambe video ke liye *YouTube Audio Library* ke royalty-free tracks chunein. Apne channel ko safe rakhne ke liye abhi *subscribe* karein!""",
9: """Kya aap bhi comments mein *Sub for Sub* maang rahe hain? Aap anjaane mein khud apne hi channel ki *reach khatam* kar rahe hain! Aur jo *teesra kaaran* main aapko aakhri mein batane wala hoon, usse aapka channel hamesha ke liye *ban* bhi ho sakta hai.
Jab bhi aap naya video upload karte hain, YouTube algorithm use sabse pehle aapki *seed audience* yaani aapke subscribers ko dikhata hai. Lekin Sub4Sub wale *fake subscribers* click hi nahi karte, jisse aapka *CTR* buri tarah gir jata hai.
Par rukiye, asli *tabaahi* toh tab shuru hoti hai jab koi galti se us par click kar deta hai!
Sirf *5 second* mein video band karne se aapka audience retention khatam ho jata hai aur YouTube ka deep ranking neural network aapke video ka expected watch time *zero* maan leta hai. Iske baad algorithm aapke *impressions* poori tarah rok deta hai aur video ko suggested feed mein bhejna band kar deta hai.
Lekin sabse khatarnak sach kya hai?
Sub4Sub YouTube ki *spam aur fake engagement policy* ka seedha ullanghan hai. Isse YouTube aapke farzi subscribers ko *delete* kar deta hai aur aapka channel hamesha ke liye *terminate* ho sakta hai. Isliye numbron ke peeche mat bhagiye, sirf sahi darshakon ke liye *organic content* banaiye!""",
10: """*US target* karke YouTube channel banaya tha, lekin saare views *India* se aa rahe hain? Ise turant fix karne ke *3 kadam* hain, aur teesra kadam aisa hai jiske bina aapka algorithm kabhi *reset* nahi hoga!
US views ka RPM jahan *₹670 se ₹1300* se zyada hota hai, wahin Indian views par yeh girkar keval *₹25 se ₹150* reh jata hai. YouTube aapke poore channel ko nahi, balki har video ke shuruaati *signals* ko alag se test karta hai.
Pehla kadam hai *packaging reset*, jismein title aur thumbnail mein *dollar symbols* aur miles ya Fahrenheit jaisi *imperial units* istemaal karo aur Hinglish shabd poori tarah hata do. Lekin kya sirf packaging badalne se views America chale jayenge, jab tak aap doosra kadam sahi na karo?
Doosra kadam hai *timing sync*: video raat *11:30 baje IST* yaani America ke dopahar *2 se 4 baje EST* par upload karo. Kyunki jab Bharat so raha hota hai, tab algorithm aapka video America ke active darshakon par test karta hai.
Aur ab aata hai sabse mukhya teesra kadam, jiske bina organic reach milna lagbhag namumkin hai!
*Google Ads* par *Presence-only USA* filter lagakar *20 dollar* ka seed campaign chalao. Jaise hi *1,000* active American viewers ka data banega, YouTube ka algorithm USA mein aapki organic recommendation shuru kar dega!""",
}
